cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use MatVu in your research, please cite it using this metadata.
title: "MatVu: automatic viewpoint optimization and visualization for materials structures"
abstract: >-
  MatVu analyses a materials structure, automatically chooses a clear viewing
  direction by optimising projected atom spread and occlusion, and renders
  publication-ready ball-and-stick figures. It reads POSCAR files, treats
  periodic crystals, 2D materials and molecules uniformly, and offers several
  look styles and user-editable colour/radius themes.
authors:
